# Facility party invitations

Birthday invitation themes are customer-entered text and should be interpreted as common kids TV/game/movie/team/character themes using fuzzy matching and safe approved artwork lookup.

- Keep aliases and theme IDs in `src/lib/facility-parties/invitations/theme-catalog.ts` so they persist in the repo.
- Do not require a strict dropdown for party theme.
- Use approved artwork only when registered in `approved-artwork.ts`. Otherwise use inspired/generic motifs — never invent copyrighted character art.
- The matched theme must drive the booking-form preview, saved invitation snapshot, admin print view, guest share view, and 4-per-page sheet.
- Customers may type a new theme to rematch (this resets the alternate counter) or load up to 3 other same-family inspired/generic invitation styles. Persist the chosen option index/variant; do not re-randomize later.
